          "body": "Oh, I forget, it's on the last svn version.\n\nto fix it, we just have to add this to project.xml :\n\n        <dependency>\n          <groupId>xerces</groupId>\n          <artifactId>xercesImpl</artifactId>\n          <version>2.6.2</version>\n            <properties>\n                <war.bundle>true</war.bundle>\n            </properties>\n        </dependency>\n",
